WEBVTT

00:02.592 --> 00:06.262
No one from Koichi's family
knows where he went either.

00:06.387 --> 00:09.098
They're talking about calling the police.

00:09.182 --> 00:11.100
So he really is missing.

00:11.392 --> 00:13.268
Yukako's nowhere to be seen, either…

00:13.436 --> 00:15.980
I feel like it's my fault.

00:17.023 --> 00:19.608
You don't think he's dead, do you?

00:19.734 --> 00:21.986
No, I don't think things
have come to that, yet.

00:22.070 --> 00:24.238
But she's holding him captive.

00:24.405 --> 00:26.657
We've got to find him fast.

00:27.241 --> 00:29.117
I have a feeling we don't have
much time left,

00:29.202 --> 00:30.453
if we want to find him alive.

00:33.665 --> 00:35.458
Damn thing won't open!

00:35.541 --> 00:38.001
I can't believe this is happening!

00:37.418 --> 00:39.795
Q.
IN WHAT YEAR DID COLUMBUS
DISCOVER THE "NEW WORLD"?
THE CORRECT ANSWER
WILL OPEN THE LOCK.

00:39.879 --> 00:42.923
Wait, it was a movie, wasn't it?

00:43.007 --> 00:46.343
But I never watched it
'cause it looked so long!

00:47.679 --> 00:50.431
I think I'm almost there…

00:51.224 --> 00:54.101
1, 4, 0, 0…

00:55.436 --> 00:58.021
What was it…?

01:20.503 --> 01:22.922
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:24.590 --> 01:27.884
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

01:28.261 --> 01:31.555
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

01:31.806 --> 01:36.306
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

01:38.771 --> 01:42.065
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

01:42.150 --> 01:45.778
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

01:45.862 --> 01:50.362
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

01:54.996 --> 01:59.496
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

02:02.003 --> 02:05.423
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

02:05.506 --> 02:10.006
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

02:20.897 --> 02:25.276
EPISODE 9
YUKAKO YAMAGISHI
FALLS IN LOVE, PART 2

02:26.360 --> 02:29.821
I washed your underwear and
pajama bottoms, you know.

02:33.618 --> 02:34.577
What's wrong?

02:36.579 --> 02:39.039
Now how am I supposed
to know if you refuse to speak?

02:39.457 --> 02:42.168
I-I'm a freshman in high school.

02:42.877 --> 02:44.670
This is beyond…

02:45.838 --> 02:47.339
I'm not embarrassed.

02:47.590 --> 02:49.925
I feel like a completely pathetic
human being.

02:50.426 --> 02:53.429
Please, would you just stop it?

02:54.222 --> 02:56.432
You hate me now, don't you?

02:56.891 --> 02:58.267
I disgust you, don't I?

02:59.560 --> 03:01.770
Just let me go home!

03:02.063 --> 03:05.149
What could you possibly like about
someone who just peed his pants?

03:07.026 --> 03:08.485
Oh, Koichi, you poor, pitiful thing.

03:09.111 --> 03:12.781
Yukako must be putting your
heart through so much torment.

03:14.367 --> 03:16.619
Yukako is a bad girl.

03:17.078 --> 03:19.455
<i>Nothing I say has any effect!</i>

03:19.872 --> 03:22.040
<i>I-I think I'm gonna cry…</i>

03:22.333 --> 03:25.836
<i>First I wet myself, and now this…</i>

03:27.088 --> 03:28.297
But Koichi…

03:29.757 --> 03:33.093
The moment you said
you were a pathetic human being,

03:33.511 --> 03:35.513
I saw a sparkle deep in your eyes…

03:36.389 --> 03:39.225
I saw something intoxicating.

03:40.393 --> 03:43.813
Like you have an ace up your sleeve.

03:46.107 --> 03:49.693
That is what I like about you.

03:50.236 --> 03:52.446
That is what makes me
want to learn more about you.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.991
And when you're in love,

03:56.367 --> 03:58.827
what's a little poop or snot, right?

03:59.620 --> 04:00.996
I'm surprised you'd worry.

04:01.289 --> 04:05.668
Washing your pants
filled me with joy.

04:09.630 --> 04:10.380
Look!

04:12.925 --> 04:15.844
I'm making an electric chair.

04:16.345 --> 04:18.722
I'll be sure it's ready for
our dinner-time studies.

04:23.936 --> 04:26.730
I was thinking about
making Italian tonight.

04:27.356 --> 04:29.191
I should stock up on olive oil.

04:31.485 --> 04:32.402
We'll have fun.

04:37.116 --> 04:39.243
H-Help me!

04:39.660 --> 04:41.870
<i>She keeps getting fiercer and fiercer!</i>

04:42.163 --> 04:43.622
<i>I've got to escape fast,</i>

04:43.748 --> 04:46.041
<i>o-or she's seriously going to kill me!</i>

04:47.919 --> 04:48.669
<i>But…</i>

04:51.213 --> 04:53.131
<i>How do I get out of here?</i>

04:57.678 --> 05:00.806
But Koichi's got Reverb, though.

05:01.015 --> 05:04.727
Even if someone's keeping him quiet,
he can still call for help, right?

05:05.519 --> 05:08.897
But Reverb has a range of
about 50 meters.

05:09.607 --> 05:12.651
He might've been
taken somewhere isolated.

05:13.194 --> 05:15.279
That could be anywhere!

05:18.199 --> 05:18.991
<i>Wait!</i>

05:19.367 --> 05:22.161
<i>She said she was going
to buy some olive oil.</i>

05:22.662 --> 05:25.081
<i>But I can't imagine
she'd go grocery shopping now</i>

05:25.665 --> 05:27.249
<i>Maybe a phone order?</i>

05:30.962 --> 05:31.712
Could it be…?

05:37.426 --> 05:39.261
<i>It is! A pay phone!</i>

05:40.388 --> 05:42.640
<i>And 48 meters away! Yes!</i>

05:42.848 --> 05:44.683
<i>Just within range!</i>

05:46.227 --> 05:47.478
<i>Reverb is a sound Stand!</i>

05:48.020 --> 05:50.981
<i>Now I can signal Josuke for help!</i>

05:54.485 --> 05:57.488
<i>I don't have any 10 yen coins!</i>

05:58.030 --> 06:00.073
<i>I was taken here in my pajamas!</i>

06:00.282 --> 06:02.158
<i>Should I dial 110?</i>

06:02.660 --> 06:05.621
<i>But she might kill the police!</i>

06:05.705 --> 06:08.958
<i>I'm just gonna have to
contact Josuke somehow!</i>

06:09.542 --> 06:12.836
You were wondering whether there was
a pay phone nearby, weren't you?

06:15.589 --> 06:17.299
Y-Yukako…

06:17.383 --> 06:20.552
I know exactly what you're thinking.

06:20.928 --> 06:23.305
Since I told you I was
going to buy some olive oil,

06:23.764 --> 06:25.474
you thought a pay phone
must be nearby.

06:25.766 --> 06:28.560
Then you reasoned it didn't matter,
because you had no 10 yen coins.

06:28.853 --> 06:30.479
That's what you thought, right?

06:30.980 --> 06:33.565
I-Is there a pay phone?

06:34.108 --> 06:35.859
Hmph. Feigning ignorance, I see.

06:36.610 --> 06:38.987
I would give up on
the notion of calling someone.

06:39.447 --> 06:42.491
You're not taking one step
outside this house.

06:43.159 --> 06:47.079
And just in case, I'm going to go
destroy the phone's 110 button.

06:48.748 --> 06:50.082
Would you like anything?

06:50.416 --> 06:52.251
N-No, I guess not…

06:57.465 --> 06:59.341
<i>W-What is wrong with her?!</i>

07:00.301 --> 07:03.387
<i>S-So that's it…
I can't communicate with anyone…</i>

07:12.980 --> 07:17.480
BEEP BEEP BEEP

07:13.689 --> 07:15.899
What's this writing?

07:18.861 --> 07:20.821
Why is there sound coming
from my hand?

07:22.907 --> 07:24.658
It's calling someone!

07:25.159 --> 07:27.452
I never dialed any number!

07:29.955 --> 07:31.206
<i>Hello? Higashikata speaking.</i>

07:32.541 --> 07:33.291
I got through!

07:33.584 --> 07:35.252
If the right touch tone signals
are transmitted,

07:35.336 --> 07:36.712
a push-button phone will connect!

07:38.047 --> 07:41.383
Hello, Koichi, is it you?
Hey! It's me, Josuke!

07:41.842 --> 07:43.134
<i>Koichi, where are you?</i>

07:44.178 --> 07:46.263
<i>What is that?
I hear waves crashing…</i>

07:48.557 --> 07:50.058
Koichi, you…

07:51.977 --> 07:54.604
You have a power like me!

07:56.190 --> 07:59.735
Yes! Josuke's gonna come here
for sure now!

08:00.069 --> 08:01.695
With a car, it'll only take him
15 to 20 minutes!

08:02.196 --> 08:03.572
I just gotta hold out until then!

08:04.031 --> 08:05.699
Somehow I'll do it!

08:07.618 --> 08:10.078
The sound of waves…
A pay phone…

08:12.164 --> 08:13.540
The only place Koichi could be…

08:13.958 --> 08:15.000
is right here!

08:17.878 --> 08:18.753
Koichi.

08:20.256 --> 08:21.298
Koichi!

08:22.091 --> 08:23.425
She's coming back!

08:23.676 --> 08:25.594
I-I've no choice but to fight!

08:40.025 --> 08:41.484
Open this door, Koichi.

08:42.570 --> 08:44.488
Wh-Why don't you just
break it down then?

08:44.864 --> 08:48.367
<i>A broken door will
definitely make Josuke suspicious!</i>

08:53.998 --> 08:56.291
You've made Yukako very happy.

08:57.710 --> 09:02.210
I'm so happy you have
powers like I do, Koichi.

09:03.549 --> 09:06.468
Though it irritates me
you kept this a secret.

09:06.886 --> 09:08.554
Still, I'm happy you're like me.

09:09.263 --> 09:13.225
Because when a man and a woman are
going to share their lives together,

09:13.434 --> 09:14.893
nothing's more important than

09:14.977 --> 09:17.229
a relationship built on
love and shared values, right?

09:17.521 --> 09:20.857
We have something no one else has.

09:20.941 --> 09:24.069
We can be the perfect couple!

09:25.779 --> 09:27.030
So please, Koichi…

09:27.489 --> 09:28.656
Open the door, okay?

09:35.122 --> 09:37.499
When I tell you to open
the door, you open the door!

09:37.917 --> 09:38.834
I HATE YOU

09:40.502 --> 09:41.252
I HATE YOU

09:44.340 --> 09:48.840
I HATE YOU

09:47.927 --> 09:52.348
I hate you! I hate you! I hate you!
I hate you! I hate you!

09:52.431 --> 09:54.933
- Perfect couple?!
- I hate you! I hate you! I hate you!

09:55.184 --> 09:58.020
Can't you understand
how much I hate all this?!

09:58.229 --> 10:00.189
That noise will bombard you

10:00.314 --> 10:03.066
until you renounce your love for me
and cry for forgiveness!

10:00.481 --> 10:04.981
I HATE YOU

10:07.321 --> 10:08.280
What is this?

10:08.364 --> 10:10.783
Such nonsense is inaudible to me.

10:11.951 --> 10:12.701
Huh?!

10:15.496 --> 10:17.289
Th-This isn't…

10:18.082 --> 10:20.042
at all like what happened
with Tamami.

10:20.501 --> 10:21.960
Her delusions are too strong!

10:22.628 --> 10:25.547
I didn't think it'd be
completely useless on her…

10:28.592 --> 10:31.595
I've finally found the one person

10:31.762 --> 10:34.347
I'm bound to
with the red thread of fate.

10:35.015 --> 10:36.891
Some people never find
their soulmate.

10:37.685 --> 10:39.687
You still don't understand
how lucky we are?

10:45.609 --> 10:46.651
Koichi…

10:47.528 --> 10:50.822
My plan was to turn you into
an outstanding man,

10:50.990 --> 10:52.449
but I've changed my mind.

10:53.242 --> 10:56.745
Until you fall in love with me,
you will remain in this house.

10:57.162 --> 10:59.581
You will love me!

11:00.416 --> 11:01.458
Or else…

11:03.377 --> 11:04.795
I might murder you.

11:06.255 --> 11:08.882
<i>No matter what, I can't let her in here…</i>

11:09.174 --> 11:11.301
<i>I need to land one more attack
with Reverb!</i>

11:11.593 --> 11:14.804
<i>If I really go all out,
I'll unleash a sound louder than before.</i>

11:15.389 --> 11:16.264
Reverb!

11:23.022 --> 11:24.231
Something's wrong with Reverb…

11:24.898 --> 11:25.648
Reverb!

11:27.568 --> 11:28.569
<i>It's not moving!</i>

11:30.821 --> 11:32.572
I-Is it dead?

11:33.240 --> 11:36.326
Did my Stand die of despair?

11:37.953 --> 11:41.331
Reverb is dead!

11:45.336 --> 11:48.047
REVERB

11:48.464 --> 11:51.800
N-No! M-My…

11:52.092 --> 11:55.804
Reverb's become completely lifeless!

11:58.766 --> 12:01.018
A Stand is a manifestation
of the soul.

12:01.101 --> 12:05.601
It was too much pressure.
I pushed it too far!

12:08.108 --> 12:10.568
Reverb…

12:11.195 --> 12:11.945
What?!

12:12.029 --> 12:14.114
Wh-What is that?

12:14.782 --> 12:15.991
That's what you call a "Stand"?

12:16.408 --> 12:18.243
What is that Stand?

12:20.162 --> 12:21.830
Get this cabinet out of my way!

12:22.581 --> 12:24.249
She's gonna kill me!

12:24.625 --> 12:28.170
If she comes through that door
and catches me, she'll kill me!

12:36.303 --> 12:37.929
Open this door, Koichi!

12:40.224 --> 12:42.684
<i>Don't come through that door!</i>

12:43.143 --> 12:46.396
<i>If only that door could
blow her far, faraway…</i>

12:49.858 --> 12:51.484
It's gone! It's just a shell.

12:51.819 --> 12:52.694
Where did you put it?

12:53.153 --> 12:53.736
Huh?

12:53.821 --> 12:56.532
I said, where did you put it?!

12:56.657 --> 12:57.407
Huh?!

13:01.036 --> 13:01.661
Th…

13:01.745 --> 13:02.537
That's…

13:03.038 --> 13:06.166
Wh-What is this? My Reverb

13:06.542 --> 13:07.876
i-is alive!

13:08.669 --> 13:11.713
Did it just emerge a new form
from its old body?

13:12.131 --> 13:13.048
What is this?

13:13.424 --> 13:17.136
The design's changed only a little.
Besides, it shrank.

13:17.219 --> 13:20.096
Changing shape
won't do you any good!

13:20.973 --> 13:22.099
I-It's fast!

13:26.019 --> 13:27.270
Wh-What is

13:27.354 --> 13:28.271
this wind?!

13:30.858 --> 13:33.026
It blew her away!

13:33.318 --> 13:36.446
I have no idea how,
but some kind of wind blew her away!

13:41.368 --> 13:43.078
Wh-What just…

13:44.037 --> 13:45.121
happened to me?

13:46.790 --> 13:49.543
That's Reverb's writing on the door…

13:47.875 --> 13:51.587
FWOOSH

13:54.923 --> 13:58.301
So she touched the graffitied door,
and the writing became real!

13:58.552 --> 14:03.052
FWOOSH

13:58.760 --> 14:02.221
The sensation of "Fwoosh"
actually blew her away.

14:02.681 --> 14:03.578
I wished the door would
blow her away…

14:06.727 --> 14:09.646
I had no idea,
but I was actually controlling it!

14:10.606 --> 14:12.107
This is the new Reverb!

14:12.858 --> 14:14.484
Reverb Act 2!

14:18.071 --> 14:18.946
Koichi…

14:22.701 --> 14:25.704
CROWN

14:24.411 --> 14:25.495
So it's them…

14:27.748 --> 14:30.208
The one place I know that's
by the sea with lots of empty houses

14:30.292 --> 14:31.793
is this vacation spot.

14:32.085 --> 14:35.963
Yeah, but, there's tons of
houses around here.

14:36.298 --> 14:37.924
Who knows which one he's in?

14:38.091 --> 14:41.803
Our answer's a phone booth!
Koichi called us from a public phone.

14:42.679 --> 14:47.179
First, we find the phone booth,
then we search the houses nearby.

14:47.434 --> 14:48.184
Yeah.

14:50.395 --> 14:53.981
Sweet, adorable Koichi belongs to me.

14:55.442 --> 14:57.527
And I'll never let
anyone else have him.

15:05.953 --> 15:09.081
I suggest you keep
your distance, Yukako.

15:11.291 --> 15:13.042
You should take my word for it…

15:13.377 --> 15:16.880
There's no way you can
compete with Reverb Act 2's abilities.

15:18.048 --> 15:20.008
You can't keep me here.

15:24.304 --> 15:26.306
Now my left eyelid is twitching.

15:26.682 --> 15:30.727
Since I was a kid, getting upset
always set off my orbicularis oculi,

15:31.478 --> 15:34.022
like I was about to get violent.

15:34.648 --> 15:37.317
You know, one stupid
little modification

15:37.401 --> 15:39.152
doesn't suddenly make you
a big shot on campus!

15:39.319 --> 15:41.279
I'm going to have to get
a little rough now!

15:42.447 --> 15:44.699
It's hot!

15:45.242 --> 15:46.993
H-How could you?!

15:47.077 --> 15:50.371
You burned my hand!
You flattop-wearing piece of shit!

15:50.455 --> 15:52.790
When you said "get a little rough,"

15:52.874 --> 15:54.792
did you mean show off
your vulgar mouth?

15:56.670 --> 15:58.880
How dare you do this to me?!

15:59.298 --> 16:00.674
Snot-nosed shrimp!

16:01.216 --> 16:03.218
You are mine!

16:03.343 --> 16:05.219
You belong to me,
yet you dare defy me?!

16:06.013 --> 16:07.889
I own you!

16:08.181 --> 16:09.724
Reverb Act 2!

16:11.310 --> 16:12.060
I missed?

16:17.024 --> 16:17.774
Josuke.

16:18.108 --> 16:18.858
I heard it.

16:19.192 --> 16:21.360
It sounded like something broke.

16:21.778 --> 16:23.738
Hey, I think it's that house.

16:25.032 --> 16:27.743
I can't believe she can
make her hair grow this much…

16:28.493 --> 16:30.077
Her soul is too strong.

16:30.662 --> 16:32.914
It's a dark, vindictive soul…

16:35.042 --> 16:37.419
Reverb was it?

16:37.961 --> 16:39.837
Now that the secret's out,
your abilities disappoint me.

16:40.547 --> 16:43.007
All I have to do is keep
from touching that writing.

16:43.383 --> 16:45.176
So I'll ask you one more time…

16:45.761 --> 16:47.971
You do love me, don't you?

16:50.891 --> 16:54.519
Go ahead and try to say
you don't love me.

16:55.604 --> 16:58.773
I'll tear you and this house
apart right now.

16:59.733 --> 17:03.069
And if you die, you'll be mine
for all eternity.

17:03.654 --> 17:07.366
You'll remain forever in
my heart as my personal memory.

17:09.451 --> 17:11.035
Answer me now!

17:11.244 --> 17:13.037
I've told you,
but you just don't get it.

17:13.455 --> 17:15.457
That's why I'm in this whole mess.

17:16.708 --> 17:19.085
For the umpteenth time,
I don't like you!

17:19.795 --> 17:20.921
And that's the last time.

17:23.048 --> 17:25.008
You're dead, Koichi!

17:29.054 --> 17:30.680
DOGON

17:30.931 --> 17:32.682
I've already told you this too.

17:33.016 --> 17:35.977
You won't be able to
keep hold of me for long.

17:37.062 --> 17:39.230
You're touching the very writing
that will blow you away.

17:40.107 --> 17:43.401
That flattop-wearing piece of shit's
writing is all over, me that is!

17:56.498 --> 17:58.124
Her hair turned white!

18:01.086 --> 18:03.379
She's not dead, is she?

18:06.508 --> 18:07.467
She's alive!

18:09.177 --> 18:11.721
<i>She might be a deranged she-devil,</i>

18:12.180 --> 18:14.140
<i>but I guess I should
be happy about this.</i>

18:19.980 --> 18:22.691
I wasn't able to keep hold of you,

18:22.774 --> 18:26.194
but I figured out that destroying
your Stand is just as good!

18:27.529 --> 18:28.905
Disrespectful punk!

18:28.989 --> 18:30.198
Idiot!

18:33.952 --> 18:36.871
She can still attack?

18:36.997 --> 18:38.623
Her will is insane!

18:38.749 --> 18:41.042
Shut up!

18:41.126 --> 18:44.963
How dare you,
you pantie-wetting prick?!

18:45.297 --> 18:48.842
How dare you do this to me?!

18:49.718 --> 18:53.555
You made my treasured hair
turn white,

18:53.805 --> 18:56.015
you pathetic little jerk off!

18:57.184 --> 18:59.936
I loved you!

19:00.020 --> 19:03.440
But you will not get away
with doing this to my gorgeous hair!

19:03.815 --> 19:07.401
No one gets away with
undermining my beauty!

19:09.613 --> 19:14.113
I'm gonna yank off your piss-soaked prick
and rip out your insides!

19:15.535 --> 19:16.827
S-Stop…

19:16.912 --> 19:17.954
Silence!

19:19.915 --> 19:22.125
You're gonna end up
like that, too, aren't you?!

19:24.544 --> 19:26.712
What? What was that sound?

19:27.756 --> 19:31.634
Let go of Reverb and
grab hold of something.

19:31.718 --> 19:33.010
The cliff is going to crumble.

19:33.887 --> 19:36.306
When Reverb was listening
for your heartbeat,

19:36.389 --> 19:39.392
it also heard the earth splitting.

19:39.476 --> 19:43.438
Hah! Don't try to bullshit me
to save your own hide!

19:52.656 --> 19:55.784
I've got to let go
to grab onto something else!

19:56.076 --> 19:56.868
Shit!

19:56.952 --> 19:59.913
I-I don't have… time!

20:04.751 --> 20:07.795
BOING

20:14.094 --> 20:15.720
Like I said, the ground crumbled.

20:16.513 --> 20:20.808
Then again,
nothing I say to you sinks in.

20:24.771 --> 20:27.148
You mean
you had placed it there already?

20:29.401 --> 20:31.986
When I was trying
to rip Reverb apart…

20:32.946 --> 20:36.407
you stuck that writing on
the rock beneath the cliff?

20:37.576 --> 20:40.287
When I was trying to kill Koichi,

20:41.329 --> 20:44.749
he was thinking of saving me!

20:46.042 --> 20:49.211
I-I've lost.

20:51.464 --> 20:55.964
No, I lost the moment I met Koichi.

21:00.056 --> 21:02.767
Hey, Koichi! Are you okay?

21:02.851 --> 21:04.018
You all right, Koichi?!

21:05.020 --> 21:07.022
Josuke! Okuyasu!

21:07.147 --> 21:10.567
Where were you guys?! Jeez!

21:11.401 --> 21:15.029
B-But I love him even more now.

21:17.490 --> 21:20.075
I don't care if he gives me
the cold shoulder.

21:21.161 --> 21:23.204
Just thinking about Koichi

21:24.164 --> 21:25.206
makes me happy!

21:25.498 --> 21:28.375
Hey, look! Is that Yukako?

21:28.752 --> 21:30.462
Her hair's turned completely white!

21:30.795 --> 21:32.046
Wow, you're right.

21:32.422 --> 21:36.922
But the way she's smiling
she looks like she couldn't be happier.

21:37.218 --> 21:38.802
And she's looking over here.

21:38.887 --> 21:39.512
Huh?!

21:39.596 --> 21:42.015
You're right. Now that's creepy.

21:42.933 --> 21:44.059
Let's get outta here!

21:44.142 --> 21:45.935
Save me, Josuke!

21:46.019 --> 21:47.437
Don't look at me!

21:49.189 --> 21:52.400
Well, I'll be.
Didja see that, Masaji?

21:52.859 --> 21:55.820
I'm still sober, Gramps!

21:57.656 --> 22:02.156
MORIOH LANDMARK 2
CAPE BOING
DIRECTIONS: ASK A LOCAL FISHERMAN
FOR "CAPE BOING,"
AND HE WILL RESPOND IN KIND
BY TAKING YOU THERE BY BOAT.

21:58.740 --> 21:59.866
<i>Cape Boing…</i>

22:00.283 --> 22:02.201
<i>After apparently witnessing
a young woman jump to her death</i>

22:02.285 --> 22:05.955
<i>only to bounce off the rocks
with a gentle "Boing!" …</i>

22:06.039 --> 22:07.331
<i>a pair of fishermen</i>

22:07.749 --> 22:10.084
<i>created an urban legend
and a new appellation.</i>

22:13.546 --> 22:14.421
Hirose!

22:14.756 --> 22:17.091
You really gave it your all
this time, didn't you?

22:17.217 --> 22:19.010
That's what happens
when you study.

22:17.884 --> 22:19.677
ENGLISH EXAM ANSWER SHEET
TEST 3 KOICHI HIROSE

22:20.303 --> 22:21.178
I don't…

22:22.263 --> 22:24.515
know how I should feel about this.

23:38.506 --> 23:41.509
EPISODE 10
LET'S GO EAT SOME ITALIAN FOOD
